  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Climate Improvement Program (Subprogram 1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support sustainable economic growth by promoting private sector development.  Specifically, it was agreed that it would include three main components:  (i) reducing regulatory burden and compliance cost; (ii) improving SME access to credit and leasing products; and (iii) developing policy and regulatory framework for public-private parnerships (PPP).</narrative>
  </description>
